message: "If you use this audit or its code, please cite this release."
title: "When Compressed CRPS Depends on Measurement Units: An Affine Metamorphic Audit and Stable Correction"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23302078
authors:
