abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a source-specific audit of a public CRPS
  compression implementation. The package includes an affine-standardized
  weighted CRPS wrapper, exact tests, weather and bike-demand validations,
  cross-package affine controls, a public source-history audit, and runtime
  comparisons.
